{"title":"Replace The Substring For Balanced String","difficulty":"Medium","statement":"You are given a string s of length n containing only four kinds of characters: 'Q', 'W', 'E', and 'R'.\nA string is said to be balanced if each of its characters appears n / 4 times where n is the length of the string.\nReturn the minimum length of the substring that can be replaced with any other string of the same length to make s balanced. If s is already balanced, return 0.\n\nReplace one substring by any string of equal length so each of Q,W,E,R occurs exactly n/4 times. Return the shortest replacement length, or 0 if already balanced.\n\n## Examples\n\n### Example 1\n\n```text\nInput: s = \"QWER\"\nOutput: 0\n```\n\nExplanation: s is already balanced.\n\n### Example 2\n\n```text\nInput: s = \"QQWE\"\nOutput: 1\n```\n\nExplanation: We need to replace a 'Q' to 'R', so that \"RQWE\" (or \"QRWE\") is balanced.\n\n### Example 3\n\n```text\nInput: s = \"QQQW\"\nOutput: 2\n```\n\nExplanation: We can replace the first \"QQ\" to \"ER\".\n\n## Constraints\n\n- n == s.length\n- 4 ≤ n ≤ 10^5\n- n is a multiple of 4.\n- s contains only 'Q', 'W', 'E', and 'R'.\n","starterCode":"class Solution:\n    def balancedString(self, s: str) -> int:\n        pass\n","entryPoint":"Solution().balancedString","parameters":[{"name":"s","type":"str"}],"returnType":"int","tests":[{"input":["EEEEQEEREEWRWQEQWRQWREEERQQERREREWWWEQWQQQRERRRWWWEEQRWEERQWRRQR"],"expected":7},{"input":["EEEERREREQQQRWWEREQRQRREQRWRQQQWWWEE"],"expected":3},{"input":["EEEEWQQEEWEWEEERWQEEWQWQ"],"expected":8},{"input":["EEEEWRWEWWREQERQWWWWEQQWQQQREEQWRWWEWEQEWQWQ"],"expected":7},{"input":["EEEQQQERREWQRRQEEWQQWREQEERQQWWERWQQQEWRQRWEQQWEWWWRRWWQ"],"expected":3},{"input":["EEEQRRRRREWQWWRRWREQREWQREWQWEREEWWWRQRWEQWEEEERRWEQWEEWQEQE"],"expected":7},{"input":["EEEQWEWEWEERQQERQWEWEEQQWEWEWQEEEWQEQEQQRQEQEREWQWEEQEER"],"expected":22},{"input":["EEEREEERERQWQQQEWWEQQRQWWEEEEEWQEQQEQWEQWEREEERRQRRWQEQEQWRWEWQREWQRERWRRQERWRRREWWERQRW